omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2mtLnhzDsbgQ7kNvwGYxQrv&_nc_oc=AdotS0A8Z209iSnsTCgHf68KLEENZKd_b0pjKta7qVQWk1Hh8buSQGa_L5skvaaz7YU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2Xk9LQlUI7Z3cXdrWVL2IumwNAYhF3LKzw-geyKfwRaQ&oe=69D27E34"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Joqy5EcYSJgQ7kNvwGjAnce&_nc_oc=AdrkkKgTZivLEm3kwmKQuZh9EpXd4bS6lhd9jHI8a7G3h6hXN4FcH7e1N5LszbjQnqI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1ZJ9s6LwEk0eSvvYvZy0SmYCL1FG-D9vYV7MbWDbh2Pw&oe=69D24756"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2TBOi50SgTUQ7kNvwHoQRcJ&_nc_oc=AdrXb3bNkChE50Mjd4PsNgH8YsvDn5EctJSV7QL7zmb-jIBGHlkyimujg8wdFDzHqKE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1TJClMfsTV3L0DfSmXQJY-vj6H5LYZ7p2ql1gbvse5jA&oe=69D25C77"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://